  "description": "\"Explore the city paths or enjoy your commute with our first skinny-tire electric cycle! The skinnier tires are perfect for paved paths and the congested nature of city life.The Skinny you have been waiting for!The Vamoose City Commuter elevates commuting and touring in the city to a new level! The City Commuter comes standard with 26” x 2.4” tires, making it perfect for on-road or paved city paths, and comes with a ANANDA 500W Mid Drive motor for high-performance gearing!\n\nThe City Commuter comes with a 48V 15Ah in-frame battery producing 720 Watt-hours of performance – a +55 km range!This cycle comes standard with the following adders:\n\n• 48V 500W ANANDA mid-drive motor\n\n• 48V 15Ah battery\n\n• A 6061 aircraft aluminum frame with alloy front forks\n\n• 1:1 intelligent pedal assist system (PAS)\n\n• KD686 LCD colour display\n\n• Powerful and quick 3A charger\n\nSPECIFICATIONS\n\nMotor Format:\nSingle-MID\n\nFront Motor:\nN/A\n\nMid Motor:\nANANDA 48V 500W\n\nRear Motor:\nN/A\n\nDerailleur and shifters:\nSHIMANO Tourney 7-SPEED\n\nThrottle:\nYes - RIGHT HAND TWIST\n\nDisplay:\nKD686 LCD colour\n\nBattery:\n48V 15 Ah Samsung\n\nCharger:\n3A\n\nFront forks :\nVAMOOSE BOXER\n\nRear Suspension:\nn/a\n\nDropper Seat Post:\n\nFrame:\n6061 Aluminum\n\nBrakes:\nUnion Star hydraulic disc 2 piston, 180 mm rotor\n\nWheels:\n26\"\" X 2.4\"\" KENDA City\n\nPedals:\nWellgo\n\nSaddle:\nVelo VL-6221 Black\n\nFront and Rear Racks:\nRear, with front mount option\n\nFenders:\nAluminum\n\nFront and rear lights:\nLED Wired\n\nADDITIONAL ATTRIBUTES\n\nTorque (per motor):\n130 Nm MAX Torque\n\nWatt Hours:\n720\n\nMiles per charge:\n36\n\nKms per charge:\n58\n\nBattery charge time:\n4-6 hrs.\n\nUSB Plugin:\nYes\n\nWEIGHTS AND DIMENSIONS\n\nBox dimensions (cm):\n153 x26 x 84\n\nBox dimensions (inch):\n60 x 10 x 33\n\nWeights (metric):\n33kgs NW / 41kgs GW\n\nWeights (imperial):\n72lbs NW / 90lbs GW\n\nMax Speed (metric):\n32 km/h max speed\n\nMax Speed (imperial):\n20 m/h max speed\n\nMax Load:\n330 lbs.",
